          "end": 118.6,
          "en": "click, the effect still will be the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 118.6,
          "end": 124.78,
          "en": "It triggers submit form and there we will collect all the data and emit our custom save event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 125.11,
          "end": 127.99,
          "en": "Of course, being able to cancel would also be nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 128.89,
          "end": 132.37,
          "en": "Hence I'll add a second button where I say cancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 134.02,
          "end": 136.43,
          "en": "I'll actually move that in front of the save button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 136.45,
          "end": 140.59,
          "en": "I'll give this a mode of outline so that it looks a bit differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 140.59,
          "end": 144.43,
          "en": "And here, of course, I don't want to submit, but I do want to cancel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 144.43,
